message: "If you use this question set or these results, please cite them as below. Each GitHub release is archived on Zenodo with its own DOI; the doi field is the concept DOI (latest version) and identifiers carries the version DOI."
type: dataset
title: "freightutils-eval: frontier language models on 300 freight reference questions — alone, with the FreightUtils tools, and with web search"
authors:
  - family-names: Cristoiu
    given-names: Marius
    affiliation: FreightUtils
